  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Georgia&apos;s Labour Market</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to strengthen Georgia&#x2019;s labour market by promoting constructive social dialogue between employers&#x2019; and worker&#x2019;s organisations, fostering inclusive growth, decent work, and increased productivity while aligning with international/EU labour market standards, promoting occupational safety and health, and enhancing the workforce&#x2019;s adaptability through up- and reskilling.</narrative>
  </description>
